UR  - https://basel.swisscovery.org/openurl/41SLSP_UBS/41SLSP_UBS:live?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:36681302&id=doi:10.1016%2Fj.jad.2023.01.069&issn=0165-0327&isbn=&volume=325&issue=&spage=817&pages=817-823&date=2023&title=Journal+of+Affective+Disorders&atitle=Depression+and+anxiety+disorders+during+the+postpartum+period+in+women+diagnosed+with+attention+deficit+hyperactivity+disorder&aulast=Andersson&pid=%3Cauthor%3EAndersson+A.%3BGarcia-Argibay+M.%3BViktorin+A.%3BGhirardi+L.%3BButwicka+A.%3BSkoglund+C.%3BBang+Madsen+K.%3BD%27onofrio+B.M.%3BLichtenstein+P.%3BTuvblad+C.%3BLarsson+H.%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E2022398161%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EArticle%3C%2FDT%3E
