UR  - https://basel.swisscovery.org/openurl/41SLSP_UBS/41SLSP_UBS:live?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:10.1002%2Fpds.4864&issn=1099-1557&isbn=&volume=28&issue=Supplement+2&spage=215&pages=215&date=2019&title=Pharmacoepidemiology+and+Drug+Safety&atitle=Prevalence+and+predictors+of+ADHD+medication+use+in+a+cohort+of+pregnant+women&aulast=Lemelin&pid=%3Cauthor%3ELemelin+M.%3BBoukhris+T.%3BSheehy+O.%3BBerard+A.%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E629265087%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EConference+Abstract%3C%2FDT%3E
