T1  - Generation of a human induced pluripotent stem cell (iPSC) line from a 51-year-old female with attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder (ADHD) carrying a duplication of SLC2A3
A1  - Jansch C.
A1  - Gunther K.
A1  - Waider J.
A1  - Ziegler G.C.
A1  - Forero A.
A1  - Kollert S.
