UR  - https://basel.swisscovery.org/openurl/41SLSP_UBS/41SLSP_UBS:live?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:20620028&id=doi:10.1016%2Fj.eurpsy.2010.03.012&issn=0924-9338&isbn=&volume=26&issue=8&spage=482&pages=482-483&date=2011&title=European+Psychiatry&atitle=High+frequency+of+childhood+ADHD+history+in+women+with+fibromyalgia&aulast=Reyero&pid=%3Cauthor%3EReyero+F.%3BPonce+G.%3BRodriguez-Jimenez+R.%3BFernandez-Dapica+P.%3BTaboada+D.%3BMartin+V.%3BNavio+M.%3BJimenez-Arriero+M.A.%3BHoenicka+J.%3BPalomo+T.%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E50986306%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EArticle%3C%2FDT%3E
