T1  - Pseudo-seizure, an Atypical Presentation of Attention-Deficit Hyperactivity Disorder in a Female: A Case Report.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1177/11795735211063985
A1  - Yong Qun Leow, Timothy
A1  - Sadhu, Raja
A1  - Mayall, Mark
