T1  - Anxiety, mood, and substance use disorders in adult men and women with and without attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder: A substantive and methodological overview.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.neubiorev.2023.105209
A1  - Hartman, Catharina A
A1  - Larsson, Henrik
