T1  - Females with ADHD: An expert consensus statement taking a lifespan approach providing guidance for the identification and treatment of attention-deficit/ hyperactivity disorder in girls and women.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12888-020-02707-9
A1  - Young, Susan
A1  - Adamo, Nicoletta
A1  - Asgeirsdottir, Bryndis Bjork
A1  - Branney, Polly
A1  - Beckett, Michelle
A1  - Colley, William
