T1  - Clinical Characteristics of Women with ADHD in Japan.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2147/NDT.S232565
A1  - Hayashi, Wakaho
A1  - Suzuki, Hirohisa
A1  - Saga, Nobuyuki
A1  - Arai, Gosuke
A1  - Igarashi, Reiko
