T1  - A female carrier of ornithine carbamoyltransferase deficiency masquerading as attention deficit-hyperactivity disorder.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.braindev.2013.09.009
A1  - Kim, Se Hee
A1  - Lee, Jin Sook
A1  - Lim, Byung Chan
A1  - Kim, Ki Joong
A1  - Hwang, Yong Seoung
A1  - Park, June Dong
