T1  - Differences at brain SPECT between depressed females with and without adult ADHD and healthy controls: etiological considerations.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/1744-9081-5-37
A1  - Gardner, Ann
A1  - Salmaso, Dario
A1  - Varrone, Andrea
