N1  - Comment in (CIN)
N2  - Fibromyalgia and ADHD share some clinical features, and a reduced dopamine function has been proposed for both disorders. Here we found, in a large sample of fibromyalgia female patients, a higher frequency of childhood ADHD antecedent when compared with healthy women. Our data suggest that Fibromyalgia and ADHD have some common etiopathological mechanism.<ovid:br/><ovid:br/> Copyright &#xa9; 2010 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.
